idade+terra/copies/7","size":4,"safePixels":4,"materials":["gravidade","terra"],"paintedPixels":[4,0],"missing":["terra"]}],"failures":[],"interpretation":["Production scenes are opaque. Body masks and protected colours are tested separately on transparent Pix objects through public painters.","The pair/catalog product is exhaustive at frame zero only; 8-frame flight, return and six-copy coverage uses 240 balanced form/pair fixtures, not the entire product.","Every catalog form occurs in the animated fixtures. All 240 ordered pairs occur there, with 40 repeated forms to balance the unequal axis sizes.","Triples are exhaustive without order on one representative intention sphere. Larger sets, concepts, words and eight-member orbits are explicitly sampled axes.","The separate fused/linked sample covers all ordered pairs and all catalog forms with a balanced240-fixture mapping; only actual shared families receive fusion metadata.","Budget reports describe the generic public compositor after protected-pixel filtering. They do not claim every material is legible in every tiny sprite, or measure handcrafted sphere-body regions.","No visual-quality score or mobile frame-rate claim is inferred from passing geometry checks.","underBudgetProbes means at least one material slot received zero painted pixels after protection. represented means at least one counted pixel, not a minimum two-pixel signature or legibility guarantee.","The geometry graph follows occupied safe pixels; final painting protects dark cuts and peak colours. Connected graph ownership is not proof of final recoloured-pixel connectivity.","Fusion fixtures exercise the renderer with synthetic valid-family metadata; this sweep does not execute the full rune checker.","protectedColorChecks includes unoccupied transparent pixels; it is not a count of distinct eyes, faces or semantic marks.","The direct transparent-Pix probes use public intention/glyph painters and public material painters. They do not expose or substitute the internal production body, including special coherent-sprite routes.","Not every subset of sixteen elements crossed with every form, size, seed, concept, direction and quantity is exhaustively enumerated. Full pair products and the explicitly listed sample axes are the measured scope.","The remaining sixteen under-budget probes are two miniature whip fixtures at size four across eight phases. The renderer reports these missing colour slots honestly and retains the existing per-component minimum and primary-dominance contracts. This is not a proof that every alternative allocation is intrinsically impossible."],"comparisonToPreviousReview":{"previousReportSha256":"a034ccf4e48c216da2277ca99e7f0ab300f891a55eec55f6b1d8abf2dd2476f6","previousProductionBundleHash":"fdf8dd02302c470a2defb4ed9777386c87b8d260d8e37ce97d391ad3abb85d02","previousUnderBudgetProbes":40,"currentUnderBudgetProbes":16,"sameHarnessAndFixtureCount":true,"changedRuntimeSources":["src/ui/pixel-intention-nature.ts","src/ui/pixel-intention.ts","src/ui/pixel-mixture-compositor.ts","src/ui/pixel-mixture-contact.ts","src/ui/pixel-mixture-domains.ts","src/ui/pixel-scene.ts","src/ui/pixel-serpent-surface.ts"],"interpretation":"Same public-renderer fixtures and harness as the previous universal review. Missing miniature material slots reduced from forty to sixteen; the remaining samples are two size-four whip fixtures over eight phases."}}
